  (text "Firmware (P-11): pass-through -> EN_CHG_TMR=0, EN_TERM=0, VFB_REG for 4.04 V/cell float. Default mode keeps the 12 h timer (half rate in IAC_DPM); after expiry recover by toggling ~CE (EXP_INS_CHG_DIS) or EN_CHG (BQ25756 DS 6.3.x safety timer)."
